":["miko","medge","zegana","kaszira"],"location":"zonot-five","importance":"major","page":"wiki/medge","order":2301,"story_date":"","storyline":"Guilds of Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":9,"quote":"initiating her mutation","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=initiating%20her%20mutation","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Medge","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=initiating%20her%20mutation","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Medge\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"medge-e7","era":{"date":"2018-10-05","era":"grn","label":"Guilds of Ravnica"},"summary":"Medge advocates for her students, who are allowed to pursue their dreams; Kaszira gets to study in the zonots and Medge reconciles with Ptero to train protectors together.","participants":["medge","kaszira","ptero-zallik"],"location":"zonot-five","importance":"major","page":"wiki/medge","order":2301,"story_date":"","storyline":"Guilds of Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":10,"quote":"reconciled with her rival, Ptero","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=reconciled%20with%20her%20rival%2C%20Ptero","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Medge","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=reconciled%20with%20her%20rival%2C%20Ptero","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Medge\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e0","era":null,"summary":"Medge shows her students a motionless elder monk, and Kaszira calculates how long he has meditated from the plankton on him.","participants":["medge","kaszira","miko","chessa"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/p