iples-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=The%20Guardian%20Project%20has,They%27re%20taking%20eighteen%20spots.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Principles of Unnatural Selection\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e2","era":null,"summary":"Medge takes her eight students beyond the safe waters to watch a krasis in action, where they witness a krasis kill a resplendent benthid.","participants":["medge","krasis","resplendent-benthid","kaszira","miko","chessa"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","order":681,"story_date":"2019-02-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"A stinger erupts from the tip of the krasis's tail and strikes a killing blow on the beast's soft underbelly.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=A%20stinger%20erupts%20from,the%20beast%27s%20soft%20underbelly.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Principles of Unnatural Selection","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=A%20stinger%20erupts%20from,the%20beast%27s%20soft%20underbelly.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Principles of Unnatural Selection\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e3","era":null,"summary":"A voice rasping 'passage' draws Medge, Kaszira and Miko into a wreck, where they find a ghost.","participants":["medge","kaszira","miko","andrik","heckless"],"location":"rav